                            <p id="detail-ppdb-catatan" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed mt-1"></p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[11px]">Waktu Terdaftar:</span>
